{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"a85e3f63ba1c67cd3a98686bf5856b855e91db2e4a00bfd361c614a018897cc9","ja":"みんなで講演の内容を見直し、\n改めてリハーサルが行われて……","zh":"大家一起重新审视了演讲的内容，\n再次进行了彩排……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"ae5cabdc216433a59b3e414421137bcac2fa024094a07f345e644c19e77dba4a","ja":"……以上で、交通安全教室を終わります。\n本日お話ししたこと、覚えていただければ幸いです。","zh":"……以上就是交通安全讲座的全部内容。\n今天所讲的事情，如果能对大家有所帮助，我将不胜荣幸。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"53fbbb16d7839d8f47fba871a27d04a54e0dcc0fa06dca36030160bc515333b6","ja":"パチパチパチパチパチ……","zh":"啪啪啪啪啪……","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"344b105727c839e622cc91a6809cf0633cd9eab8b65d0bac64c29d848ace4eea","ja":"大したもんだねぇ。\nあたし、聞きいってしまったよぉ。","zh":"真了不起呢。\n我都听得入迷了呀。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"62fd2a5566be5f92a1a4569263fee793eab8e6fadb08e934cd10b8f15784000f","ja":"交通ルールを、\nすっごくわかりやすく勉強できました♪","zh":"交通规则学得\n特别轻松易懂♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"d5916eefd4cc2dc67c4be159bb0734df7b66a16c9f137bb11829625f23cd2c73","ja":"ありがとうございます。\nおふたりのおかげで、自信をもって教壇に向かえます！","zh":"谢谢二位。\n多亏了你们，我才能充满自信地走上讲台！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[20].text","source_sha256":"aed92382c4ee8a611bb82e5330157a6f96ca4541f146c5b2ab379fc4b64f3ff0","ja":"そして紬の一日署長が行われた。\nその翌日……","zh":"然后紬担任了一日警察署长。\n第二天……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[21].text","source_sha256":"5ebf5a9398a379d9790d4426c6476118cfaef8695c67f61c30430ed525bcacc8","ja":"あ、ネットニュースになってますよ！\n「凛としたアイドル署長、警察署に降臨！」って！","zh":"啊，上网络新闻了哦！\n写着“凛然偶像署长降临警署！”呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[22].text","source_sha256":"82c1c4f79d8023215a8ea414180d578ccbce21d2fa9ea43f4f175c2b913393d9","ja":"制服も、なまら似合ってるし、\n立派な一日署長だったんだねぇ。","zh":"制服也特别适合你，\n真是一位了不起的一日署长呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"f5ecdaa9a61547cb2b1e37f49a2d5ac5a68e177856a03dc9e2ac012a7e0c8693","ja":"そんな……褒めすぎです。それに交通安全教室の成功は\nおふたりのお力添えがあってこそですから。","zh":"哪有……您过奖了。而且交通安全讲座能够办得这么成功，\n也是多亏了两位大力相助。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"1b8fd76c75ad2902a9e745dfe352498682c860898a821b8a1db9a8a982294088","ja":"それに、実際に授業を行うことで\n改善点が見つかりました。","zh":"而且，通过实际开展授课，\n也发现了需要改进的地方。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"4b114c4639e4d8156a09ac8f34dd3f0a63943b85805bc750fc112cfa8082d150","ja":"もしよろしければ、また、\n練習に付き合っていただけませんでしょうか。","zh":"如果方便的话，\n能不能再陪我练习一下呢？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"d9978c71ea99fc212ad091fe7c650531010df5b86ffd135b4845815c37399044","ja":"えっ？　一日署長は終わったのに……ですか？","zh":"诶？明明一日署长的工作已经结束了……还要继续吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"dc6ae3f10f7aee1aa11fe1b76d358314976f69f49d6d9cec86e1c712c4cb6fb6","ja":"はい。また同じようなお仕事をいただいた際には、\n完璧に成し遂げたいのです。鉄は熱いうちに打たんと！","zh":"好的。下次再接到类似的工作时，\n我希望能做到完美。打铁要趁热呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"e9f6a07605c46eabc3be2ad6456b2a2d870d0705ebf77c6683aae5f3f790b0d5","ja":"はあ～……紬さん、すごいねぇ。\nあたしでよければ、もちろん付き合うよぉ。","zh":"哈～……紬小姐，真厉害呀。\n如果不嫌弃我的话，我当然奉陪啦。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1659.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"d8394c9d09cfaa9e825e50340f16c2fa2f6c36ec2d546dccc6824b635c57cd18","ja":"はい、私もぜひ！\n全力でついていきま～す！","zh":"好，我也很想去！\n我会全力跟上的～！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
